{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, קַדִּישׁ","hw":"קַדִּישׁ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קַדִּישׁ</span></big>  <strong>adj. holy</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:10\" href=\"/Daniel.4.10\">Dn 4:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">20</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁין</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:5\" href=\"/Daniel.4.5\">4:5</a> +, cstr. -<span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:18\" href=\"/Daniel.7.18\">7:18</a> +;—gods <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:5\" href=\"/Daniel.4.5\">Dn 4:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:6\" href=\"/Daniel.4.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:15\" href=\"/Daniel.4.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">5:11</a>; as subst., of angels <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:10\" href=\"/Daniel.4.10\">4:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:14\" href=\"/Daniel.4.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">20</a>; of Isr. (as holy ones, saints) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:21\" href=\"/Daniel.7.21\">7:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:22\" href=\"/Daniel.7.22\">22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קַדִּישֵׁי עֶלְיוֹנִין</span> <em>saints of the Most High</em> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:18\" href=\"/Daniel.7.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:22\" href=\"/Daniel.7.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:25\" href=\"/Daniel.7.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:27\" href=\"/Daniel.7.27\">27</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, קול","prev":"BDB Aramaic, קדשׁ"}